                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "227431580",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199035719445",
                            "num_reviews": 9,
                            "playtime_forever": 31,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 31,
                            "last_played": 1729921310
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Truly a spectacular assortment of a game, words dont even have the strength to invoke the sort of feelings this game enchanted me with. If a game were to ever match this games level of brilliance, I would think I would be playing a game designed by a choir of Angels. To even call this a game feels like shooting myself in the chest, it’s much much more than can be described as a game. Without this game, I don’t think I would be the same person I am today. It’s every line of dialogue cuts deep as a knife into my heart, it all amounts to a  subtleness I can’t describe!\n\n-A truely devoted fan in the dungeons and geese fandom.",
